1071
00:18:25,710 --> 00:18:28,460
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Fratello! Fratello! Rispondimi!{angy}</font>

1072
00:18:28,460 --> 00:18:29,380
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Zoro?!</font>

