00:18:31,340 --> 00:18:32,340
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Zoro!</font>

1074
00:18:32,340 --> 00:18:34,260
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Ehi, veloci, fatelo salire sulla barca!{Cora}</font>

