1090
00:19:14,760 --> 00:19:18,760
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">È una strada più ardua del superarmi.{angy}</font>

1091
00:19:18,760 --> 00:19:21,520
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Chissà, ho appena iniziato.{angy}</font>

1092
00:19:22,600 --> 00:19:24,230
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">È vivo!{angy}</font>

1093
00:19:24,600 --> 00:19:25,980
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Ha solo perso i sensi!{angy}</font>

1094
00:19:25,980 --> 00:19:27,020
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Fratello!{angy}</font>

1095
00:19:27,020 --> 00:19:29,150
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Fratello! Rispondimi!{angy}</font>

1096
00:19:29,820 --> 00:19:30,900
