1113
00:20:16,650 --> 00:20:18,820
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Re dei Pirati?!{angy}</font>

1114
00:20:22,410 --> 00:20:23,410
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">No!{nessuno!-angy}</font>

1115
00:20:23,410 --> 00:20:25,200
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Siete un bel team. - angy}Siete una bella squadra.{Cora}{dice team però (messed up english) -angy}</font>

1116
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:28,120
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Voglio incontrarvi ancora.{angy}</font>

1117
00:20:29,120 --> 00:20:31,250
