00:21:37,440 --> 00:21:38,440
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Sì!{angy}</font>

1137
00:21:38,440 --> 00:21:39,690
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Andiamoci!{angy}</font>

1138
00:21:39,690 --> 00:21:44,870
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Uomini! C'è stata un'interruzione, ma il vero combattimento comincia ora!{Cora}</font>

1139
00:21:44,870 --> 00:21:46,540
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Ci prenderemo quella nave!{angy}</font>

